    "media:imagetext": "Quick Facts\nabout the\n314 Boeing Clipper\nThe 41 tom Boring 314\nClipper is the largest arplane\nbut in America.\nkis a bigh wing mo\nthing boat.\nI has accommodations for 74\npassengers on short day trips\nand 40 on long over-night\nGer: 8 Men.\n152 f. Wing Spread.\n109 k. Long.\n28 6\" High.\nGross Weight 82,500 los.\nWeight empty 48,700 los.\nPower, Four 1500 H. P.\nWight Cycone engines.\nCaries 3600 gal. of fuel.\nTop Speed about 200 m.p.h.\nCruising Speed 150. m.p.h.\n# 50% power and 10,000 k\nAbsolde celing 24,000 H\nrising range about 4,000\n-les wih 40 passengers in still\nNX\n18\n601\nPAN AMERICAN AIRWAYS'\nSUPER CLIPPER. FOR TRANS-OCEANIC SERVICE\n*\nBOEING 314 CLIPPER\nSCALE 13\" -1\nSCALE MODEL ASSEMBL\nStrom Becker\nALL PARTS COMPLETE",
